      {
        "number": 13,
        "internalPageId": 13,
        "title": "Sentences Questions Negative statements 0. John works in a farm. Does he work in a farm? He doesn’t work in a farm. 1. Pedro is an architect. 2. Maria administers a restaurant. 3. Eucaris works in a gas company 4. Johannes and Jake are English teachers. 5. 6. 7. 8.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "Sentences Questions Negative statements 0. John works in a farm. Does he work in a farm? He doesn’t work in a farm. 1. Pedro is an architect. 2. Maria administers a restaurant. 3. Eucaris works in a gas company 4. Johannes and Jake are English teachers. 5. 6. 7. 8.",
          "A. Change the following sentences into the interrogative and negative form. Follow the example. Pay attention if the sentences have verb To Be or not. Finally, add your own sentences, questions and negative statements in the spaces provided."
        ],
        "links": [],
